@startuml
title "Domain Model - Player"

rectangle Game
rectangle Player
rectangle Name
rectangle Hand
rectangle Action
rectangle Card
rectangle Surrender
rectangle TurnAction
rectangle Board
rectangle PutCard
rectangle MoveCard
rectangle AttackCard
rectangle EquipCard
rectangle PassTurn

Game *--> "2..N" Player

Player *--> Name

Player *--> Hand
Hand o--> "0..N" Card

Player --> Action
Action ..> Hand
Action <|-- TurnAction
TurnAction ..> Board
TurnAction <|-- PutCard
TurnAction <|-- MoveCard
TurnAction <|-- AttackCard
TurnAction <|-- EquipCard
TurnAction <|-- PassTurn
TurnAction <|-- Surrender


note as TurnActionNote
	When the player has the turn, they can perform
	actions that cannot be done without the turn,
	we call this actions, **TurnAction**
end note
TurnAction .. TurnActionNote
@enduml
